{"schema":"scion.state/2.0","id":"poem_06","num":"06","title":"RESURRECTING ATLANTIS","tagline":"a city comes up out of the water","district":"The Light Gate & Atlantis Central Plaza","color":"#bb7362","src_fps":12,"xsheet_fps":24,"frames":168,"seconds":14.0,"assets":{"cel":"assets/poem_06_cel.webp","rough":"assets/poem_06_rough.webp","masks":"assets/poem_06_masks.webp","atlas":{"cols":12,"rows":14,"cell":[384,216],"count":168},"rough_atlas":{"cols":12,"rows":14,"cell":[256,144],"count":168},"mask_atlas":{"cols":14,"rows":1,"cell":[256,144],"count":14},"video":"../video/poem_06/cartoon.mp4"},"cuts":[],"dramatic":{"two_seconds_before":"a city comes up out of the water. Before frame 1 we are already inside 'THE COMETS': the city was moving before the camera arrived, so the opening beat is a stimulus already in progress, not a cold start.","causal_chain":["STIMULUS","ANTICIPATION","ACTION_EXTREME","ANTICIPATION","ACTION_EXTREME"],"beats":[{"id":"B01","role":"STIMULUS","heuristic":true,"f_in":0,"f_out":58,"dur_src":58,"dur_24":116,"energy":9.551,"camera_speed":0.041,"sign":"time","sign_image":"Time-image","verb":"something in the world changes \u2014 the figure against cloud, railing, vehicle","movement":"THE WATERLINE FALLS","line":"Resurrecting Atlantis. Here we are all one \u2014 the pact we","key_frame":0,"mask_key":0,"opens_on_cut":false},{"id":"B02","role":"ANTICIPATION","heuristic":true,"f_in":58,"f_out":69,"dur_src":11,"dur_24":22,"energy":12.407,"camera_speed":0.019,"sign":"perception","sign_image":"Perception-image","verb":"the body/camera loads against the coming move \u2014 building against sidewalk, sculpture","movement":"ADMISSION","line":"A relearned currency, we reassess as the admission. But here we are all safe. An unfamiliar, flickering candle light, illuminating smiles at night.","key_frame":61,"mask_key":60,"opens_on_cut":false},{"id":"B03","role":"ACTION_EXTREME","heuristic":true,"f_in":69,"f_out":109,"dur_src":40,"dur_24":80,"energy":12.731,"camera_speed":0.038,"sign":"action","sign_image":"Action-image (SAS)","verb":"the move reaches its extreme \u2014 building against sidewalk, van","movement":"NARROW STREETS","line":"Where shadows cast from narrow streets beaming with love \u2014 in the joyful noises that color rainbows, and give us infinite time to heal, and set clouds free.","key_frame":101,"mask_key":96,"opens_on_cut":false},{"id":"B04","role":"ANTICIPATION","heuristic":true,"f_in":109,"f_out":118,"dur_src":9,"dur_24":18,"energy":11.997,"camera_speed":0.036,"sign":"perception","sign_image":"Perception-image","verb":"the body/camera loads against the coming move \u2014 the figure against street lamp, building, plant","movement":"CROSSHAIRS TO CONTINUUMS","line":"I know my soul \u2014 and it could stay here forever. Leaving behind crosshairs for continuums, and strains for serendipity.","key_frame":109,"mask_key":108,"opens_on_cut":false},{"id":"B05","role":"ACTION_EXTREME","heuristic":true,"f_in":118,"f_out":168,"dur_src":50,"dur_24":100,"energy":12.078,"camera_speed":0.067,"sign":"action","sign_image":"Action-image (SAS)","verb":"the move reaches its extreme \u2014 the figure against sky, wall, ceiling","movement":"WELCOMING ALL","line":"A city born in unison, out of the purest of fictions \u2014 welcoming me, and welcoming all.","key_frame":154,"mask_key":156,"opens_on_cut":false}],"keys":[{"id":"K01","frame":0,"beat":"B01","role":"STIMULUS","silhouette_key":0},{"id":"K02","frame":61,"beat":"B02","role":"ANTICIPATION","silhouette_key":60},{"id":"K03","frame":101,"beat":"B03","role":"ACTION_EXTREME","silhouette_key":96},{"id":"K04","frame":109,"beat":"B04","role":"ANTICIPATION","silhouette_key":108},{"id":"K05","frame":154,"beat":"B05","role":"ACTION_EXTREME","silhouette_key":156}],"flip_test":{"mean_key_change":0.431,"reads":true,"note":"keys must differ enough to tell the story with no in-betweens"},"staging_topologies":[{"frame":0,"horizon":0.371,"figure_scale":0.079,"negative_space":0.921,"silhouet